k in himself though  according to snyder and reinforced by a  scene a few minutes earlier  wayne manor is set to become the new  hall of justice  giving the justice league a new hq and  importantly  one with room for a few new members of  course it's unclear how long the new  headquarters will last but  after experiencing the epic and dark  journey that is the snyder cut  it feels like an awfully nice note to  end on  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

